    "text": "OpenAI kills a lot of its products\n\nSora lasted 6 months, Agent Builder 8 months, Group Chat 8 months, Atlas 9 months...\n\nMost of the time (Sora excepted?) their own product became obsolete within months, in case you think they are immune to misjudging the exponential themselves",
