    "username": "emollick",
    "nickname": "Ethan Mollick",
    "text": "This is some good advice on working with a Dot (I will never stop capitalizing it, OpenAI!) but also a sign of the issues with the UX of Dot (& all personal agents) right now: you can't easily tell what they are working on, what they know about you, and what they will do for you",
